  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sound of Youth Scholarship Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sound of Youth Scholarship Program has supported 200 young people who were affected by the devastating earthquakes that took place in the southeastern part of Turkey on February 6th, 2023. In cooperation with Spotify, TOG provided scholarships to university students affected by the earthquake by enabling them to continue their academic education. Now, the Sound of Youth Scholarship Program is looking for your support to reach more people.</narrative>
  </description>
